# Necrotic Ooze: "As long as this creature is on the battlefield, it has all activated abilities of all creature cards in
# all graveyards." On turn 2 Bot2 casts Walking Ballista for X = 0, and it dies as a 0/0 (CR 704.5f): a creature card in
# Bot2's graveyard. Bot1's Ooze has both its activated abilities, as its own (CR 613.1f; the ruling: an ability that names
# its card names the Ooze): on turn 3 "{4}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature" puts the counter on the Ooze (a 5/4), and
# "Remove a +1/+1 counter from this creature: It deals 1 damage to any target" takes it off again to deal Bot2 1: the Ooze
# is its printed 4/3 and Bot2 is at 19. Before the Ballista died (turn 1) the Ooze had no ability to offer (the refusal).

